KLING 3 PROMPT - short directed shot
Use @image_2 as the visible visual identity / final look reference. Use @image_1 only to clarify subject identity details if @image_2 is not enough. Use @video_1 as the motion and camera reference. Use @image_3 only if a background/environment reference is actually provided.

