${videoAttributionBlock('geminiOmni')}

GEMINI OMNI FLASH PROMPT - conversational multimodal edit
Create or edit the video using the roles above. Preserve @video_1's camera path, timing, motion rhythm, composition changes, and action beats. Replace its visible subject/style with the identity and final look from @image_2, using @image_1 as the subject sheet when finer identity details are needed. Use @image_3 as the background/environment reference only if it is provided.

What must stay the same: @video_1 motion timing, camera behavior, key action beats, spatial continuity, and framing evolution.
What must change: the visible subject identity, materials, lighting style, grade, and final look should match @image_2 / @image_1 instead of @video_1.
Camera: ${cam}. ${videoPrecisionLine(prec)}

${videoActionLine(act)}
${videoPhysLine(phys)}

Do not show the original subject or render style from @video_1. Do not change protected subject identity from @image_2 / @image_1. Keep the result physically plausible, temporally stable, and coherent through the whole clip.

